5 Conclusion
In conclusion, the application value in predicting the clinical outcome of LACC patients who received chemoradiotherapy was compared. This method can non-invasively predict the clinical outcomes of local recurrence or distant metastases. It offers objective and scientific data to support clinical decision-making, enabling clinicians to develop individualized treatment plans in a more rational and scientific manner.
